# Settings and preferences

Treat appearance as a personal preference that people can undo. Keep it beside Home Assistant’s own profile settings, and save it through the native preference, not a separate store.

These examples are local previews with invented values. They do not control a home. Open an example to see it at full width or read its HTML.

